# The frappe / ERPNext / HRMS release tags production runs — the ONE source for the image
# build (release-image.yml → Dockerfile build args) and for CI's reused test benches
# (_app-tests.yml), so tests run on exactly what ships. Bump deliberately, all three at once.
# HRMS (Frappe HR) is baked in for every store; a store gets it only when its site runs
# `bench install-app hrms` (attendance, shifts, leave).
FRAPPE_REF=v16.52.0
ERPNEXT_REF=v16.51.1
HRMS_REF=v16.52.0
